Dragon dataset
==============
The dragon-H geometry comes from the example datasets in:
  https://github.com/wangyu9/qhw-code
  Yu Wang and Justin Solomon, Fast Quasi-Harmonic Weights for Geometric Data
  Interpolation, ACM Transactions on Graphics 40(4), SIGGRAPH 2021.

The supplied dragon.mesh is a Medit-format conversion of data/dragon-H/V.mtx
and F.mtx, with coordinates rounded to nine significant digits. The exact
user-supplied mesh is included in the release for reproducibility.

