Software dependencies
=====================
NVIDIA Warp: Apache-2.0, https://github.com/NVIDIA/warp
Optional warp-cuDSS wrapper: Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/alecjacobson/warp-cuDSS
Optional NVIDIA cuDSS: distributed separately under NVIDIA's cuDSS license.
Spectra benchmark dependency: MPL-2.0, https://github.com/yixuan/spectra
Eigen benchmark dependency: MPL-2.0, https://eigen.tuxfamily.org
No Spectra, Eigen, or cuDSS library source or binaries are vendored here.

Teaser visualization
====================
The okloop jet-range palette, OKLab-to-linear-RGB conversion, and squease
function in examples/teaser_style.py are adapted from gptoolbox:
  https://github.com/alecjacobson/gptoolbox
  revision dd3554053237cd02d305b78db298d913a6196508
  imageprocessing/okloop.m, imageprocessing/oklab2lin.m, matrix/squease.m

The MIT license option is reproduced below. The alternating scalar stripes
follow Polyscope's visual convention (periodic bands, darker alternating bands):
  https://github.com/nmwsharp/polyscope/blob/master/src/render/opengl/shaders/rules.cpp

